<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal sets EDP float price at 1,750-2,250 esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal sets EDP float price at 1,750-2,250 esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The partial privatisation of state electricity concern will be priced at between 1,750 and 2,250 escudos per share, Finance Minister Antonio Sousa Franco told a news conference on Thursday.</p>
</text>
